                          "Citation": "Zouari M, Ben Ahmed C, Elloumi N, Bellassoued K, Delmail D, Labrousse P, Ben Abdallah F, Ben Rouina B. Impact of proline application on cadmium accumulation, mineral nutrition and enzymatic antioxidant defense system of Olea europaea L. cv Chemlali exposed to cadmium stress. Ecotoxicology and Environmental Safety. 2016 Jun;128():195–205. doi: 10.1016/j.ecoenv.2016.02.024.",
